  "ja123:1.1": "dummedha jātakaṃ. asabbatthagāminaṃ vācaṃ ",
  "ja123:1.2": "bālo sabbattha bhāsati, ",
  "ja123:1.3": "nāyaṃ dadhiṃ vedi na naṅgalīsaṃ ",
  "ja123:1.4": "dadhimpayaṃ maññati naṅgalīsanti. ",
  "ja123:2.1": "naṅgalīsajātakaṃ. "
